---
title: "withdrawRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: withdrawRaisedCapital(amount)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: sale not concluded
    q_check_refund --> q_check_balance: all investor refund periods expired
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period not complete
    q_check_balance --> q_calc_fees: amount <= available capital
    q_check_balance --> q_revert_balance: insufficient capital
    q_calc_fees --> q_transfer_fees: compute legionFee, referrerFee from amount
    q_transfer_fees --> q_transfer_capital: bidToken.transfer(legionAddress, legionFee), bidToken.transfer(referrer, referrerFee)
    q_transfer_capital --> q_lock_vesting: bidToken.transfer(projectAdmin, amount - fees)
    q_lock_vesting --> q_emit: capitalWithdrawn = true (locks vesting modifications)
    q_emit --> [*]: emit RaisedCapitalWithdrawn(amount, legionFee, referrerFee)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotConcluded
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotComplete
    q_revert_balance --> [*]: revert InsufficientCapital

    note right of q_lock_vesting
        INV-001: capital withdrawal locks vesting term modifications (investor protection)
        INV-002: if canceled after withdrawal, project must return full amount + fees
        INV-003: fee distribution uses basis point rates from initialization
    end note
